    {
      "id": 48,
      "msgctxt": "498844",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Understand it. Know it. Get it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "msgctxt": "498964",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "People like you have different standards\nand just see it as some peculiarity. I'm done\nexplaining it to those who can't keep up.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "msgctxt": "499204",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "After taking care of someone,\nI'M supposed to be super nice to them too!?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "msgctxt": "499908",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…jeez. Whatever happened to being always\nstrict on oneself and only slightly strict\non others?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "msgctxt": "500472",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Rin#CDEF was always a girl who coveted money and was\nstrict with slackers, but I expected her to\naccept their peculiarities and freedoms just as much.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "msgctxt": "500648",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF nods solemnly.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "msgctxt": "501520",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Just follow me. I'll do this for everyone.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "msgctxt": "502280",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Rin#CDEF. That plan of yours,\nwill someday make you the enemy of all.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "msgctxt": "503060",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "When I don't care, I don't care!\nSince I'm the Queen, I can do whatever I want!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "msgctxt": "503560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Nothing, nothing,\nyou can't even do a single thing!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "msgctxt": "503856",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But our voices don't reach #C236196003Rin#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "msgctxt": "504028",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "All we can do is to simply let ourselves flow with it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
