      "en": "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "517680",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "517736",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "517820",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "517900",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "517968",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "518008",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "518040",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "518072",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A single track descends into the darkness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "518116",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Like a roller coaster racing across\nan amusement park at night.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "518180",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Does this mean I'm going to \"the center of the heart\"―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "518240",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Can you hear me…?\nOr rather, is this reaching you…?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "518296",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Is there someone who understands\nmy voice, my heart?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "518352",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Forget it. It's no big deal, anyway.\nIt's fine if I'm not understood.\nIt's fine if I don't reach anyone.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "518460",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm what's important. I'm just trying to\nlive a life I can agree with. To do that,\nI decided to rule over everything.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "518580",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Listen here, weakling who wandered in.\nCute little #[boy][girl]#, you're too keen on meddling\nin my business. I can't have you around.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "518716",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I am the new Queen of the Moon.\nSince you just keep getting in my way,\nI have to make you understand my greatness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "518832",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This anguish of #ROFS0003#RUBS    mine #RUBEa noble#REND is too dazzling for\na worker ant who crawls on the ground.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "518948",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's right. I always give it my best.\nSo then, why do I―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "519012",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm great at studies and sports,\nI'm smart and beautiful,\nI'm the personification of elegance!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "519108",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You're all too much, fat in the heart,\nobese in the mind! I can't take it anymore.\nMy kind honors student act ends here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "519232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The days of gentle guidance have come and gone.\nNow's the time for an iron fist. That's right.\nHoarding money, and even the right to speak.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "519372",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Just you wait.\nI'll squeeze you dry 'til there's nothing left.\nI'm even doing it for your own good!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "519472",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She won't allow anything save for money,\neven extravagances of the heart?\nWhat a miser.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "519560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "However, to pile gold into one's stores without\nusing it is asinine.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "519632",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A commodity which is only saved ruins a country.\nEven hearts are the same, I think. If you do not\nflaunt it, it will break, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "519780",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "People call that a dictator.\nI'm tired of hearing the word \"great.\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "519848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Resenting her surroundings out of superiority,\nhuh… Well, never being bitter, grudgeful, or\nangry is more like the upright #C236196003Rin#CDEF we know…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "520004",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Accepting the weakness of those around her\nand putting up with things are her strengths.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "520096",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "*sigh*. #C236196003Rin#CDEF had virtues that #C236196003Leo#CDEF could only\ndream of. How could she forget that?\nShe must have had a lot of pent-up emotions.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "520256",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Her words are quite laden with significance, no?\nThough she is not my type, this sort of woman\nwould not be so bad, if made Empress.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "520392",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I agree with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's mutterings.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "520440",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…naturally, I can't agree.\nOne could say that this isn't even #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF was always a girl who coveted money and was\nstrict with slackers, but I expected her to\naccept their peculiarities and freed nature just as much.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "520692",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In any case, I'm tired. And I'm done with these\nweird, arbitrary decisions. I want to beat in\nthat insensitive #[guy][girl]# #C236196003#NICK#CDEF's head!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "520848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…that's right. You'll get the meaning behind\nwhat I'm doing soon enough.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "520924",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A-and yeah, I know my words and my attitude\nmight be hard to understand….",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "521000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What am I supposed to do about it!?\nIt's embarrassing to talk about!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "521072",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's fine. Shut up! Get where I'm coming from―\nthough there's no way you could understand!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "521164",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yeah, there's no way you can understand.\nEveryone is a blockhead, after all.\nI'm the only one who thinks seriously.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "521280",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You're cattle.\nEveryone is a stockpile.\nI'm a nest egg.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "521336",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Everything is okay, it's all okay.\nSee? A perfect manifesto, don't you think?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "521416",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So―――All you need to do\nis keep quiet and listen to what I say.\nI absolutely won't do anything bad to you!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "521528",
      "tipo": "choice",
      "medida": "choice",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…yeah, I'm too scared to answer.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "521564",
      "tipo": "choice",
      "medida": "choice",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…hold on, I take issue with this.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "521600",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Stop, you are supposed to defy her, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nThese three items are a roller coaster racing\ntowards dictatorship!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "521736",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I don't blame you. If you object the wrong\nway, she'll go into a rampage. We need to keep\nour mouths shut, tight as clams.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "521864",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But… It scares me how it feels, in some way,\nright to try leaving things to her, in her case.\nHm…? What's with this deja vu…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "521992",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You must not, Darling. Disagree with the\ndisagreeable, push back the pushy.\nHave the steel heart to say \"No\" to suitors!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "522116",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What is the matter with you?\nDo you enjoy being subservient to women?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "522188",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes, I'm of the same opinion.\nIf we listen to her as a bashful, young girl,\nwe'll only find a lowly crook.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "522296",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You've got a lot of #[pluck][courage]#… Sorry, but I'm no\ngood against the rampage of a highly-spirited\ngirl who said this to me once in the past…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "522448",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "N-nevermind―you're right, however! Even if the\nend is just, if the means will bring people\nto tears, then we have to be careful!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "522580",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes. That's the spirit, Darling. #C236196003Rin#CDEF's words\nare those of a miser, devoid of compassion…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "522688",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "We must harden our hearts,\nand kick that wild #C236196003Rin#CDEF's behind\nright out of her seat as the heroine!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "522804",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That is correct. Even if she says it is meant to\nhelp, having a woman wrapped about one's purse\nis more unpleasant than if it was a snake.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "522944",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What's your problem?\nAll that buzzing of yours is really bugging me.\nYou still want to resist me?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "523044",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I can't believe this… Even after all I said,\nyou still won't try to understand me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "523128",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Fine. If you won't trust someone as\ntalented as me, then I don't care anymore.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "523208",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'm the Queen of the Moon… no, not just\nthe moon… of Earth, space, this world――\nI'm the Queen of anything and everything!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "msgctxt": "523336",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'll only do whatever I think is right.\nGood and evil, demands and fulfillments,\nbargins and rarity―I'll decide everything!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "msgctxt": "523464",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That'll be fine. No complaints, right?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
